@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:18000
@productionUrl = https://server.iprism.eu/data-ingestion

### Liveness: confirms that the FastAPI process is running
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live
Accept: application/json

### Readiness: validates configuration, MongoDB, and MinIO connectivity
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready
Accept: application/json

### UC3 readiness: checks package, UC3 configuration, MongoDB, and MinIO
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready/coastal-uc3-sentinel2
Accept: application/json

### Live health check for the ingestion service
GET {{productionUrl}}/health/live
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

### Live readiness check for the ingestion service
GET {{productionUrl}}/health/ready
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

### UC3 readiness check for the ingestion service
GET {{productionUrl}}/health/ready/coastal-uc3-sentinel2
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
